<item><title>Benin court sentences former police chief Houndégnon to 24 months</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-court-sentences-former-police-chief-houndegnon-to-24-3f1a61/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-court-sentences-former-police-chief-houndegnon-to-24-3f1a61/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The former director was convicted over online harassment and incitement to rebellion linked to his criticism of reforms under Patrice Talon.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:44:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
